  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dialogue
  speachNumber: 0
  speach:
  - Stepping into the ballroom, bright light hits your eyes.
  - a stark contrast to the dark night on the street that you were standing on just
    a few seconds ago.
  - Looking around, you see dozens of guests,
  - each dressed in formal attire and donning masks resembling various monsters.
  - A man in a zombie mask taps you on the shoulder followed by a thumbs-up as he
    appreciates the artistry that you put into your mask.
  - Across the room, you spy guests dressed as both a vampire and a werewolf standing
    together and ushering you over towards them.
  - Your heart skips a beat at the sight of the two of them, you quickly follow their
    gesture and approach.
